WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.130
I'm Janna Levin.

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:05.680
I'm the director of sciences at here at Pioneer
Works in Red Hook, Brooklyn.

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:09.599
Pioneer Works is a center for art and events
and science.

00:00:09.599 --> 00:00:15.990
It's really just an open, spirited place where
everybody brings to it what they have to offer.

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:20.660
When I first came to Pioneer Works I was scientist
in residence and I was finishing a book on

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:25.430
black holes and people couldn't really understand
why I would come to write a science book at

00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:31.350
this art space where it was loud and noisy
and dusty and people were working and exhibits

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:32.529
were coming and going.

00:00:32.529 --> 00:00:38.170
But for me it was this perfect distraction
and I would be so inspired watching the exhibits

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:43.249
come and go and it would really help me kind
of find a tone and a pace and a way to focus

00:00:43.249 --> 00:00:45.579
on my own seemingly unrelated work.

00:00:45.579 --> 00:00:48.760
So most of the time I really am doing hard
core scientific research.

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:50.239
I mean my work is very theoretical.

00:00:50.239 --> 00:00:52.260
I'm very interested in black holes.

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:57.410
I'm interested in gravitational waves, the
shape of space-time, whether extra dimensions

00:00:57.410 --> 00:00:58.510
can trap dark energies.

00:00:58.510 --> 00:01:03.079
It's very abstract, theoretical, mathematical
physics.

00:01:03.079 --> 00:01:06.900
But then when I'm writing I feel like it's
something totally different.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:12.040
When I'm writing, I'm thinking about the pace
and energy of a story.

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:17.860
It's different but the content is still usually
very scientific.

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:26.420
I love these conceptual ideas and the sense
in which abstract concepts can really shape

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:27.720
and structure a story.

